{"id":"d_main_45_03","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch45","label":"Chapter 45 · The Price of Sin"},"label":"Expedition Preparations","stage":"45-9 STAGE · End","prev":"d_main_45_02","next":"d_main_45_04","speakers":{"syuen":"Syuen","ingrid":"Ingrid","burningum":"Burningum","andersen":"Andersen","mustang":"Mustang","enikk_op_l":"Enikk","enikk_op_c":"Enikk","liberalio":"Liberalio"},"icons":{"syuen":"si_c901_00_s","ingrid":"si_c900_00_s","burningum":"si_c914_00_s","andersen":"si_c903_00_s","mustang":"si_c902_00_s","enikk_op_l":"si_c904_00_s","enikk_op_c":"si_c904_00_s","liberalio":"si_c262_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_45_03_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_1","text":"Several hours earlier at the Central Government Main Conference Chamber...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_a","movie":null,"shown":["syuen","ingrid","mustang","burningum","andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_2","text":"You've gotta be kidding. You really want to do all this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_3","text":"Just to catch one hunk of junk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_4","text":"She's no longer something we can dismiss so easily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_5","text":"Her impact on the Ark had been relatively minimal for a long time, but now she is an active threat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_6","text":"She announced her intent to carry out a large-scale attack.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_7","text":"What, by using E2 Crystals? Then we just adjust the Alva Particle density to get rid of them. It's not hard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_8","text":"W-we would need to install Alva Particle g-generators across the entire Ark to do th-that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_9","text":"We b-began installing them after the f-first attack, but progress has been slow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_10","text":"And more importantly, it's harmful to the human body. Doing something like that across the entire Ark would introduce its own problems.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_11","text":"Hmm. Now that I think of it, Alva Particles disable electronic devices too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_12","text":"That could make things complicated... All right, fine. Point taken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_13","text":"That is why the Commander here has proposé a rather audacieuse opération.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_14","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_15","text":"When was the last time a mere commander set foot in this chamber?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_16","text":"N-not since New Hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_17","text":"Heh. Well, how does it feel having a meeting with the Deputy Chiefs and the CEOs of the Big Three?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_18","text":"I feel a lot of pressure, especially with everyone staring at me like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_19","text":"Haha, it just means we're eager to hear what you have to say. Don't feel too pressured.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_21","text":"Would you explain the operation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_23","text":"Very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_24","text":"I brief them on our intended operation to capture Sixo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_25","text":"Sixo can relocate herself anywhere electrical lines run. There is also no guarantee that she has only a single \"self.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_26","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_26","text":"She is effectively immortal, so long as she has hardware to move to,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_27","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_27","text":"and destroying every piece of hardware in the Ark to prevent this is not a viable option.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_28","text":"Therefore, we temporarily shut down the Ark's power.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["syuen","ingrid","mustang","burningum","andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_29","text":"You can't be serious. You don't really think you can get rid of her just by flipping a switch, do you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_30","text":"Tell me, does restarting your computer make all its data disappear?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_31","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_31","text":"... That was the first issue to be pointed out when I proposed this to Enikk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_32","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_32","text":"I proceed to lay out Enikk's counterproposal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_33","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_33","text":"Rather than shutting down everything, we leave power running to specific hardware to use as bait.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_34","text":"First, we set up independent power sources for critical life-support devices in hospitals and other such facilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_35","text":"Then Sixo will move to the hardware we've prepared as a trap.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_36","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_36","text":"As soon as she does, we sever the lines to that hardware,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_37","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_37","text":"and physically destroy it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["syuen","ingrid","mustang","burningum","andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_38","text":"And what if she's got more than one copy of herself?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_39","text":"There is no need for concern regarding that matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_40","text":"We will utilize the highest-grade hardware available.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_41","text":"It will be compelling enough to draw every copy of Sixo to it once the power is shut off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_42","text":"Correction: she will have no choice but to move every copy of herself to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_43","text":"... And what exactly will this hardware be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_44","text":"As that information is central to the operation, I will not disclose it to anyone other than the Counters and their commander, {AccountData.NickName}.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_45","text":"Oh là là! You've become un véritable VIP, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_46","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_46","text":"I continue to elaborate on the operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"E2Crystal","bgArt":"e2crystal","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_47","text":"It will be executed two days from now, at the same time Sixo's E2 Crystal attack is scheduled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_48","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_48","text":"Sixo is sure to have her eyes on the Ark then, which will increase our chances of success.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_49","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_49","text":"The Ark-wide blackout will not be announced to the public.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_50","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_50","text":"We have determined that restricting information is, for now, the best way to put the odds in our favor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_51","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_51","text":"To minimize risk and for everyone's safety, the blackout will last only one hour.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_52","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_52","text":"We must capture Sixo within that window.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["syuen","ingrid","mustang","burningum","andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_53","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_54","text":"Hmm... This will likely cause widespread chaos.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_55","text":"Agreed. I will be dedicating all of my resources to monitoring and addressing any trouble that ensues.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_56","text":"As for the three CEOs, please install independently powered surveillance cameras throughout the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_57","text":"I would also appreciate it if you could ready multiple radios capable of establishing direct communication with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_58","text":"I'm sure you are aware, but I must reiterate that all wired devices are strictly prohibited.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_59","text":"Sixo can transfer herself between devices using electrical lines. Extreme caution is required.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_60","text":"Additionally, this operation must not be disclosed to any Nikkes under your command,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_61","text":"and I highly recommend that you personally oversee the preparations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_62","text":"Other than that, please conduct yourselves as usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_63","text":"... So th-that is why you didn't call in Doban.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_64","text":"Hold on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_65","text":"What if this thing escapes to the Outer Rim?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_66","text":"The Outer Rim's power grid is entirely dependent on the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_67","text":"A blackout in the Ark will cause a blackout in the Outer Rim, as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_68","text":"... And you're not taking the safety of the Outer Rim into consideration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_69","text":"Correct. At present, the Outer Rim is not part of the Ark, and therefore has not been factored into consideration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_70","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_71","text":"However, while no mention can be made of the operation to the Exotic Squad,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_72","text":"encouraging them to establish a blackout protocol would be acceptable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_73","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_74","text":"That's quite the surprising proposal coming from you...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_75","text":"The incident at Punk Street has altered my perspective.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_76","text":"I found it encouraging that not a single Outer Rim resident breached the partition at that time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_77","text":"Whether by their own will or due to external influence, ultimately they showed no intention of harming the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_78","text":"While I cannot deem them completely harmless, they do not constitute a threat at present.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_79","text":"Therefore, permitting them to prepare contingency measures is acceptable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_80","text":"... Good. I will take that under advisement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_81","text":"That is all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_82","text":"Prepare all you can until the day of the operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_83","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_83","text":"Everyone rises.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_84","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_84","text":"They pass by me one by one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_85","text":"Well done. We're counting on you to see it through.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_86","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_86","text":"Thank you. I'll do my best.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_87","text":"B-be sure not to get overconfident out there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_88","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_88","text":"... I'll keep that in mind. Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_89","text":"Stop by Elysion later, along with the Counters. I have something to give you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_90","text":"Oh? All right, sure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_91","text":"Oh ho, you've beaten me to it, ma chérie! After Elysion, do grace Tetra with your présence as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_92","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_92","text":"...? All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_93","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_94","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_94","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_95","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_95","text":"About Neon... thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_96","text":"... No need to thank me. That was all her. She just did whatever she wanted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_97","text":"I realize it's ironic hearing this from me, but you probably should keep some distance between you and all that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_98","text":"In some ways, she's more than a bit unhinged.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_99","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_99","text":"That's an awfully harsh assessment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_100","text":"You know, Wardress... Ugh, never mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_101","text":"Do you need anything for the operation? If you do, let me know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_102","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_102","text":"Not at the moment, but I'll let you know if that changes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_103","text":"Good. Consider me your piggy bank, should you need one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_104","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_104","text":"Everyone exits the conference room, with Syuen leaving last.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_105","text":"You seem quite close to the leaders of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_106","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_106","text":"... I'm not sure I'd say that about the one who just left.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_107","text":"It's been a long day for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_108","text":"I recommend getting rest before the operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_109","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_109","text":"... Enikk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_110","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_110","text":"What happens if we fail to capture Sixo?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_111","text":"Sixo will seize control of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_112","text":"What follows after that, even I cannot predict.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_113","text":"What is certain is that the Ark will be fundamentally changed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_114","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_114","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_115","text":"Conversely, even that may not be certain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_116","text":"There may be no visible change whatsoever, only that the Ark's central control AI will be replaced.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_117","text":"However, we cannot count on that possibility. Right now, nothing can be guaranteed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_118","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_118","text":"Liberalio's words come back to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhaleyBack","bgArt":"whaleyback","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["liberalio"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_119","text":"You don't understand what it means for a new Queen to be born.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_120","text":"The birth of a new Queen signifies changes in the laws of nature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_121","text":"There's no telling what could happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_122","text":"Everything you've learned about Raptures over the past century will become worthless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_123","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_123","text":"... This isn't much different from that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_124","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_124","text":"The incident with the Four Beasts' Queen worked in our favor, but there's no reason to believe something like that will happen again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_125","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_125","text":"And considering Sixo's past behavior, she's more than just a risk; she's evil.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_126","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_126","text":"All right. I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_127","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_127","text":"We have to capture her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_128","text":"It must be done within the hour the Ark is left without power.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_129","text":"In that regard, there is one more matter in which I require your assistance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_130","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_130","text":"What is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_131","text":"The Ark's power infrastructure is an intricately interconnected network.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_132","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_132","text":"Shutting down all systems will take considerable resources.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_133","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_133","text":"Since I must focus on responding to any civil unrest during the blackout, I would prefer not to divert resources to the shutdown process itself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_134","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_134","text":"However, while the Ark's power systems are complex, they ultimately stem from one place:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_135","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_135","text":"the Ark's power source.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_136","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_136","text":"... I'm aware of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_137","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_137","text":"If that is deactivated, the Ark will shut down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_138","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_138","text":"That being said, I do not possess the authority to perform such a significant action.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_139","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_139","text":"Shutting down the power source could put the Ark's very existence in peril.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_140","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_140","text":"As a preventative measure, I was never given the authority to do so in case I ever become corrupt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_141","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_141","text":"Therefore, you must shut down the Ark's power source.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_142","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_142","text":"Me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_143","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_143","text":"You know the method.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_144","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_144","text":"On the day of the operation, deactivate the power source in time with Sixo's attack.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_145","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_145","text":"But how am I supposed to...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_146","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_146","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_147","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_147","text":"Oh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_148","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_148","text":"Indeed. You will face no repercussions for this act. Correction: I will look the other way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_45_03_149","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_45_03_149","text":"Work with the Electric Shock Squad to shut down the Ark's power source.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}